B.y1=new A.p3(["Design begins with silence. I don't look for solutions immediately; I look for the gap between what users say and what they actually do. Understanding the unsaid is where the real value lies.","Deep Empathy","01","The Art of Listening"])
B.y2=new A.p3(["Complexity is a failure of clarity. I strip away the noise until only the essential remains. If a feature doesn't serve the primary intention, it is a distraction.","Ruthless Simplification","02","The Discipline of Reduction"])
B.y3=new A.p3(["I treat every design as a hypothesis. I build, test, and break my own ideas in the open. Polish is a reward for a validated concept, never a substitute for it.","Rapid Validation","03","The Iterative Loop"])
B.y4=new A.p3(["The last 5% is where the soul lives. I obsess over the pixel-perfect alignment, the fluidity of a transition, and the rhythm of a user's journey. Precision is the ultimate form of respect.","Architectural Craft","04","The Final Precision"])
